        "Title": "The Delgado Massacre",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112569295541",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 671746f4-eecd-417d-b0cd-1ad49e88f0c2).Image",
        "Description": "This is Diana, 47.\r\rOur client&apos;s brother was tortured and killed by the Delgados. He demands justice. Along with that, MI6 has requested us to gather evidence to inprison the Cartel. The Vanisher plans to destroy many pictures of the Cartel&apos;s atrocities, so his death is required. Rico also owns a hippo that he prizes. Enough to keep a flash drive implanted in its body. His hippo wrangler knows where it is and will destroy it if the Cartel falls. This cannot happen.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
